Homepage: https://github.com/carbon6-dev/carbon6
Description: carbon6 command line
 Runs carbon6 agent sessions from the command line, sends follow-ups, and
 lists and searches sessions, through a carbon6 head's API. Sign in once with
 `c6 login <url> --token <token>`.
